  ISSUE 1 (CRITICAL - RESOLVED):
    Package: Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore 6.0.0
    Status:  NOT APPLICABLE - This project does NOT use Entity Framework Core.
             Database access is performed via MySql.Data (ADO.NET) directly.
             MySql.Data has been updated from 8.1.0 → 8.3.0 for .NET 8 support.
             No EF Core migration is required.

  ISSUE 2 (MEDIUM - RESOLVED):
    Package: Microsoft.AspNetCore.App 6.0.0
    Status:  NOT APPLICABLE - This is a WPF desktop application (net8.0-windows),
             not an ASP.NET Core web application. Microsoft.AspNetCore.App is a
             framework reference for web apps only and is not required here.
             The TargetFramework is correctly set to net8.0-windows.

